#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
codex-usage: local Codex rollout token profiler.

Reads Codex rollout JSONL files under:
  $CODEX_HOME/sessions
  $CODEX_HOME/archived_sessions
or ~/.codex by default.

Exact metrics:
  - cumulative input/cached/output/reasoning token counts
  - model context window
  - model-call count inferred from increasing cumulative token counters
  - compaction count

Estimated metrics:
  - attribution of cumulative input to visible transcript sources
  - payload size by command/file/tool/activity

The attribution model deliberately uses model-visible response_item tool outputs
instead of event_msg/item_completed stdout copies, which may contain duplicated
or untruncated output that was not actually sent back to the model.
"""

